---
args: { decisions: DecisionAtom[], prepared: PreparedEvidence, input: CaseInput }
returns: DraftReuseMatch
---
Construct a ReuseMatch draft with its actual domain fields. Only supported values enter `values`; preserve conflicts, missing fields and evidence bindings. Propose conventional and inventive matches based on function rather than product names. Explain the adaptation mechanism and uncertainty, include multi-item bundles when useful, and reject creativity that depends on relaxing essential requirements or unapproved handling.
